{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"803475","name":"Grand Hotel Malher","description":"استمتع بموقع مركزي في باريس في فندق Grand Hotel Malher، على بُعد خطوات من شارع Rue de Rivoli ومسافة قصيرة سيرًا على الأقدام من كاتدرائية Notre Dame. يوفر هذا الفندق 28 غرفة ضيوف مُجهزة بشكل فردي مع ميني بار وأجهزة تلفزيون إل سي دي وخدمة الواي فاي المجانية. ابدأ يومك ببوفيه إفطار (مقابل رسوم)، واستفد من وسائل الراحة مثل مكتب استقبال يعمل على مدار 24 ساعة وخدمة تخزين الأمتعة. يقع كل من Place des Vosges وPlace de la Bastille على بُعد مسافة قصيرة.","address":"5 Rue Malher","city":"PARIS","countryCode":"FR","postalCode":"75004","lat":48.855616,"lng":2.361205,"stars":3,"giataCode":"422206","phone":"+33142726092","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/80/803475/803475a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/80/803475/803475a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/80/803475/803475a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/80/803475/803475a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/80/803475/803475a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/80/803475/803475a_hb_a_007.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/80/803475/803475a_hb_l_006.jpg","category":"lobby","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/80/803475/803475a_hb_l_007.jpg","category":"lobby","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/80/803475/803475a_hb_l_008.jpg","category":"lobby","order":8},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/80/803475/803475a_hb_l_009.jpg","category":"lobby","order":9},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/80/803475/803475a_hb_l_010.jpg","category":"lobby","order":10},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbed